title: "Get Voice profile"
icon: arrow-down-left
description: "Get Voice profile: getVoiceProfile in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`GET /v1/projects/{id}/platforms/voice/profiles/{profileId}`

Gets one reusable Voice profile, including its optional inbound delivery state. Requires platforms:read bound to the path project.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.projects.platforms.getVoiceProfile(input: GetVoiceProfileInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<GetVoiceProfileOutput>
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Python">
```python Python
photon.projects.platforms.get_voice_profile(input: GetVoiceProfileInput) -> models.VoiceProfile
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Rust">
```rust Rust
client.get_voice_profile(id: String, profile_id: String).await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::VoiceProfile>, Error<GetVoiceProfileError>>
```
</Tab>
</Tabs>

<RequestExample>
```typescript TypeScript
import { Photon } from "@photon-ai/api";

const photon = new Photon({
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.PHOTON_API_TOKEN}` },
});
const result = await photon.projects.platforms.getVoiceProfile({
  path: {
    id: "id",
    profileId: "profileId",
  },
});
```

```python Python
import os

from photon_api import Photon
from photon_api.rpc_generated import GetVoiceProfileInput

photon = Photon(headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {os.environ['PHOTON_API_TOKEN']}"})
result = photon.projects.platforms.get_voice_profile(
    GetVoiceProfileInput.model_validate({
        "path": {
            "id": "id",
            "profileId": "profileId",
        },
    })
)
```

```rust Rust
use photon_ai_api::{Credential, PhotonClientBuilder, SecretString};

let token = std::env::var("PHOTON_API_TOKEN")?;
let client = PhotonClientBuilder::new()
    .credential("accountServiceKey", Credential::Bearer(SecretString::from(token)))
    .build()?;
let result = client
    .get_voice_profile("id".to_owned(), "profileId".to_owned())
    .await
    .map_err(|error| format!("{error:?}"))?
    .into_inner();
```

</RequestExample>

